<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Shule Bora | School management made for Kenya</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/main.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("_header.ejs") %>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Built for Kenyan schools</span>
            <h1>More time for <em>teaching.</em> Less time on paperwork.</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
              Shule Bora brings student records, academics, fees and school
              communication into one calm, connected workspace for primary,
              junior secondary and senior secondary schools.
            </p>
            <a class="button" href="/#contact">Request a free demo</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="/students">Explore the system</a>
            <p class="hero-note">
              Designed for CBC-aligned school workflows across Kenya.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="dashboard-art"
            aria-label="School performance dashboard preview"
          >
            <div class="art-top">
              <strong>School pulse</strong
              ><span class="art-tag">Term 2 · 2026</span>
            </div>
            <p class="muted">Attendance and learning progress</p>
            <div class="art-chart">
              <span class="bar" style="height: 62%"></span
              ><span class="bar"></span><span class="bar"></span
              ><span class="bar"></span><span class="bar"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">One system. Every school day.</span>
          <h2>The practical tools your team reaches for daily.</h2>
          <p>
            From admission to assessment, Shule Bora keeps your school office
            organised and your leadership team informed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">01</span>
            <h3>Student records</h3>
            <p>
              Find learner details, guardians and class placement without
              digging through files.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">02</span>
            <h3>Academic tracking</h3>
            <p>
              Keep subjects, assessments and progress visible for better learner
              support.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">03</span>
            <h3>Fees clarity</h3>
            <p>
              Give your office a clearer view of balances and payment
              conversations.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">04</span>
            <h3>Team alignment</h3>
            <p>
              Help administrators and teachers work from the same up-to-date
              information.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">Made to grow with you</span>
          <h2>One platform for every stage of learning.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-grid">
          <article class="audience-card">
            <span class="audience-number">01</span>
            <h3>Primary schools</h3>
            <p>
              Build strong foundations with simple learner records, class lists
              and guardian information in one place.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="audience-card">
            <span class="audience-number">02</span>
            <h3>Junior secondary</h3>
            <p>
              Coordinate growing subject choices, assessments and class
              responsibilities with less friction.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="audience-card">
            <span class="audience-number">03</span>
            <h3>Senior secondary</h3>
            <p>
              Bring structure to pathways, performance conversations and the
              decisions that shape the next step.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <h2>Give your school office a clearer day.</h2>
        <p>See how Shule Bora can fit your school in a guided demo.</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@shulebora.co.ke">Talk to our team</a>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
      Shule Bora School System · Supporting schools across Kenya
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
